<title>USA: Salomon says starts Regions with hold.</title>
<headline>Salomon says starts Regions with hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers analyst Sheri Ptashek said she initiated coverage of Regions Financial Corp with a hold rating.</p>
<p>&quot;Regions is aggressively building market share through a series of community bank acquisitions in a five-state region in the southeast,&quot; Ptashek said in a research note. &quot;We believe that the current valuation already discounts the strong fundamentals.&quot;</p>
<p>Shares were up 1/8 at 45-7/8 on Tuesday morning.</p>
</text>
